{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17106200","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17106200","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1710620001:1":{"text":"오랫동안 굶주린 모양이에요. 제때 원래 모습으로 돌아와서 다행이네요.","source_cn":"这些野狼已经饿了很久，幸好我们及时变回来了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA36228D9C742FA7C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1710620002:1":{"text":"여긴... 정말 사냥터예요! 이렇게 들어올 수 있다니...","source_cn":"这熟悉的景色……我们真的进入猎场了！没想到是以这种方式……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD7F42FB4B15795C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1710620003:1":{"text":"아이고오, 짜릿해서 돌아가시겠네. 예전에 몰래 들어왔을 땐 이 정도는 아니었는데 말이야.","source_cn":"唉呀，真是紧张刺激呀，本狐之前偷溜进来可没这么麻烦呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4AA46011E6FCF041","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1710620004:1":{"text":"여우야, 네 등에 있는 검집이... 빛나고 있어!","source_cn":"哎，小狐狸，你背上的剑鞘……发亮了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEFC1AE31907BDD2B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:格温妮丝":{"text":"귀네스","source":"格温妮丝","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:小狐狸":{"text":"작은 여우","source":"小狐狸","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}